not ok OR json missing:\\n   - If 404/not found (status or body) -> call status endpoint and return existing fallback text.\\n   - Otherwise return `formatApiResult(\\\"lsp_diagnostics\\\", result)` so users see status + sanitized body snippet (HTML will show, truncated) instead of JSON parse error.\\n4) Update tests if needed (mcp-discovery test just expects tool exists).\\n\\nDeliverables:\\n- Minimal diff patch\\n- Verification steps: call lsp_diagnostics against (a) valid JSON upstream and (b) HTML upstream; confirm it no longer shows JSON parse error and instead shows `lsp_diagnostics: <status> ...` with snippet or fallback.\\n\"}},\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1}","headers":{"host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","user-agent":"openai-mcp/1.0.0","content-length":"2341","accept":"application/json, text/event-stream","accept-encoding":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd","authorization":"[REDACTED]","content-type":"application/json","mcp-protocol-version":"2025-06-18","mcp-session-id":"278f82a0-db70-413b-8a1d-12e9f0d1a344","tailscale-funnel-request":"?1","traceparent":"00-698a6fba000000003f1472586184c12d-521ce306c92aa76d-00","tracestate":"dd=s:-1;p:7bd8c522eb31f19c;t.dm:-3","x-datadog-parent-id":"12123397652391195511","x-datadog-sampling-priority":"-1","x-datadog-tags":"_dd.p.tid=698a6fba00000000,_dd.p.dm=-3","x-datadog-trace-id":"4545383647842451757","x-forwarded-for":"20.169.78.68","x-forwarded-host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","x-forwarded-proto":"https","x-openai-session":"v1/3oN9WGweOW5Rpu1bhuASBPvzqxgaKPmpJmiaG4Xson2PQImsZbUlzqsZLQyKtm2XiuDc2gk3CWFv","x-openai-subject":"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU"},"msg":"proxying to MCP"}
