rly.\\n   Apply this to sanitizeSensitiveText output so we avoid triggering entropy heuristics while keeping referential hints.\\n3) Ensure no required orchestration ids are destroyed: session/message aliasing remains the canonical mechanism.\\n4) Update docs/tool-surface-notes.md with the new sanitizer rules.\\n\\nDeliverables:\\n- Minimal diff(s)\\n- Notes on why changes are safe\\n- Quick verification checklist (show examples before/after).\"}},\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1}","headers":{"host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","user-agent":"openai-mcp/1.0.0","content-length":"2163","accept":"application/json, text/event-stream","accept-encoding":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd","authorization":"[REDACTED]","baggage":"sentry-environment=production,sentry-public_key=6884768431e4ba548d58cbf3ad96e4ce,sentry-release=com.openai.chatgpt%401.2026.027%2B2602730,sentry-sample_rand=0.0368889350848809,sentry-trace_id=373d18d834ce4146970e1750499ee95a","content-type":"application/json","mcp-protocol-version":"2025-06-18","mcp-session-id":"d6b3ac50-d341-4105-a1b9-dc1795789c75","tailscale-funnel-request":"?1","traceparent":"00-698a73d50000000094254e7f03c2277e-ece422ddfcb3f580-00","tracestate":"dd=s:-1;p:053ae4a3d5a1823f;t.dm:-3","x-datadog-parent-id":"1375799622326062778","x-datadog-sampling-priority":"-1","x-datadog-tags":"_dd.p.tid=698a73d500000000,_dd.p.dm=-3","x-datadog-trace-id":"10675024799182497662","x-forwarded-for":"20.169.78.74","x-forwarded-host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","x-forwarded-proto":"https","x-openai-session":"v1/3oN9WGweOW5Rpu1bhuASBPvzqxgaKPmpJmiaG4Xson2PQImsZbUlzqsZLQyKtm2XiuDc2gk3CWFv","x-openai-subject":"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU"},"msg":"proxying to MCP"}
