les.\\n\\nDeliverables:\\n- File/line pointers to current implementation\\n- Proposed config schema\\n- Minimal patch plan or code diff\\n- Verification steps (show exec_list returns entries; run the 3 commands above).\"}},\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1}","headers":{"host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","user-agent":"openai-mcp/1.0.0","content-length":"1932","accept":"application/json, text/event-stream","accept-encoding":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd","authorization":"[REDACTED]","content-type":"application/json","mcp-protocol-version":"2025-06-18","mcp-session-id":"9b5cb3e9-cbcb-4660-b15f-720c192abc5c","tailscale-funnel-request":"?1","traceparent":"00-698a828a00000000a5fa812320720a84-1f559be3c26bd166-00","tracestate":"dd=s:-1;p:08aba52a69d627c7;t.dm:-3","x-datadog-parent-id":"9819446823823756745","x-datadog-sampling-priority":"-1","x-datadog-tags":"_dd.p.tid=698a828a00000000,_dd.p.dm=-3","x-datadog-trace-id":"11960013748303956612","x-forwarded-for":"20.169.78.54","x-forwarded-host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","x-forwarded-proto":"https","x-openai-session":"v1/3oN9WGweOW5Rpu1bhuASBPvzqxgaKPmpJmiaG4Xson2PQImsZbUlzqsZLQyKtm2XiuDc2gk3CWFv","x-openai-subject":"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU"},"msg":"proxying to MCP"}
