 opts if found in docs.\\n   - gates-of-aker-web\\n     - cwd: orgs/octave-commons/gates-of-aker\\n     - command: npm\\n     - args: [\\\"run\\\", \\\"dev\\\", \\\"--prefix\\\", \\\"web\\\"] OR set cwd to .../web and args [\\\"run\\\",\\\"dev\\\"], whichever matches existing eco style.\\n     - env: VITE_API_BASE or similar if referenced; otherwise leave minimal.\\n3) Match existing conventions (naming, log files, restart policy, interpreter, watch settings, max memory, etc.).\\n4) Update docs if there is a README for clobber/eco defs.\\n\\nDeliverables:\\n- Exact files changed + diffs\\n- Why changes are safe\\n- How to verify quickly (commands to start the ecosystem, confirm ports 3000/5173, and confirm backend starts nREPL 7888).\"}},\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1}","headers":{"host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","user-agent":"openai-mcp/1.0.0","content-length":"2416","accept":"application/json, text/event-stream","accept-encoding":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd","authorization":"[REDACTED]","content-type":"application/json","mcp-protocol-version":"2025-06-18","mcp-session-id":"a3bf15b8-8744-41da-8bfd-08306faefc89","tailscale-funnel-request":"?1","traceparent":"00-698aa52000000000d53ad8f87b7251e9-f7a3fc6dd49ed871-00","tracestate":"dd=s:-1;p:38bce26cce698130;t.dm:-3","x-datadog-parent-id":"6461666448461320656","x-datadog-sampling-priority":"-1","x-datadog-tags":"_dd.p.tid=698aa52000000000,_dd.p.dm=-3","x-datadog-trace-id":"15364831640462447081","x-forwarded-for":"20.169.78.85","x-forwarded-host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","x-forwarded-proto":"https","x-openai-session":"v1/3oN9WGweOW5Rpu1bhuASBPvzqxgaKPmpJmiaG4Xson2PQImsZbUlzqsZLQyKtm2XiuDc2gk3CWFv","x-openai-subject":"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU"},"msg":"proxying to MCP"}
