2026-02-09T21:42:36: {"level":30,"time":1770694956707,"pid":3091284,"hostname":"err-Stealth-16-AI-Studio-A1VGG","reqId":"req-p","targetUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:3001/mcp","method":"POST","contentType":"application/json","body":"{\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"_meta\":{\"openai/userAgent\":\"Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Ubuntu; Linux x86_64; rv:147.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/147.0\",\"openai/locale\":\"en-US\",\"openai/userLocation\":{\"city\":\"Phoenix\",\"region\":\"Arizona\",\"country\":\"US\",\"timezone\":\"America/Phoenix\",\"latitude\":\"33.44838\",\"longitude\":\"-112.07404\"},\"timezone_offset_minutes\":360,\"openai/subject\":\"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU\",\"openai/session\":\"v1/3oN9WGweOW5Rpu1bhuASBPvzqxgaKPmpJmiaG4Xson2PQImsZbUlzqsZLQyKtm2XiuDc2gk3CWFv\"},\"name\":\"delegate_task\",\"arguments\":{\"agentType\":\"hephaestus\",\"title\":\"Fix session semantic search resolution (S#### aliases)\",\"prompt\":\"Problem: `list_sessions` outputs friendly aliases like `S0161 | Opencode Editor Session`, but `session_semantic_search(session=\\\"S0161\\\", ...)`, `session_messages(session=\\\"S0161\\\")`, etc return `session not found`. Titles sometimes work, but S#### aliases are unreliable across refreshes / computer switches.\\n\\nGoal: Make all session_* tools accept S#### aliases reliably, so semantic search and grep work end-to-end.\\n\\nTasks:\\n1) Locate aliasing logic in services/mcp-fs-oauth/src/index.ts: aliasFor/resolveAlias + resolveSessionRef + list_sessions formatter.\\n2) Identify why S#### fails: likely alias map keyed to per-MCP-session context (mcp-session-id) and gets reset when tools refresh.\\n3) Implement a stable alias strategy:\\n   - Store session alias mapping in a process-global map NOT keyed only by mcp-session-id (or key by a stable user identity if available).\\n   - Ensure `list_sessions` always mints/refreshes aliases into that stable map.\\n   - Ensure `resolveSessionRef` checks the stable map first, then per-session map.\\n   - Keep TTL/GC to avoid memory leaks.\\n4) Add a tool or output enhancement to help users when aliases fail:\\n   - Option A: include an additional resolvable ref in list_sessions output (e.g., `ref=<session-title>` or a short stable hash).\\n   - Option B: add a new tool `session_resolve` that maps S#### -> real session id/title.\\n   Choose the minimal change that makes S#### work.\\n5) Update docs (services/mcp-fs-oauth/docs/tool-surface-notes.md) describing the session reference contract.\\n6) Add/adjust tests to cover alias -> session_* resolution.\\n\\nDeliverables:\\n- Diff(s) with exact file changes\\n- Verification: demonstrate `list_sessions` -> take an S#### -> `session_messages` and `session_semantic_search` succeed.\"}},\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1}","headers":{"host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","user-agent":"openai-mcp/1.0.0","content-length":"2459","accept":"application/json, text/event-stream","accept-encoding":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd","authorization":"[REDACTED]","content-type":"application/json","mcp-protocol-version":"2025-06-18","mcp-session-id":"9e17d44b-1642-4da6-9099-336133fe3ad7","tailscale-funnel-request":"?1","traceparent":"00-698aa926000000007dcd3c44a3c896d2-6609925e933611cf-00","tracestate":"dd=s:-1;p:4ce19c9f4423927c;t.dm:-3","x-datadog-parent-id":"10869560158498399583","x-datadog-sampling-priority":"-1","x-datadog-tags":"_dd.p.tid=698aa92600000000,_dd.p.dm=-3","x-datadog-trace-id":"9064967890469951186","x-forwarded-for":"20.169.78.93","x-forwarded-host":"err-stealth-16-ai-studio-a1vgg.tailbe888a.ts.net","x-forwarded-proto":"https","x-openai-session":"v1/3oN9WGweOW5Rpu1bhuASBPvzqxgaKPmpJmiaG4Xson2PQImsZbUlzqsZLQyKtm2XiuDc2gk3CWFv","x-openai-subject":"v1/EoL8uJNwuHvN3hSuCC9BvtYvBPjCdVdLp6PTYPGDOQt8z4LENEQfcU"},"msg":"proxying to MCP"}
